                                "sense_id": "c745b815-f1e2-38c2-a7fd-198f0c443d31",
                                "text": "Enoch was the son of Jared, and was Noah’s great grandfather.",
                                "translation": "以諾是雅列的兒子，挪亞的曾祖父。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "70acfe95-0749-4789-9aa2-d4531cac75a7",
